DoRobot Studio

crates/dviz-protocol contains code from dviz (dorobot-org/dviz, commit 5276598),
originally dviz-core/src/zenoh_protocol.rs, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
That crate is distributed under Apache-2.0; the rest of this repository is MIT.

Files moved from dviz (dorobot-org/dviz, commit 5276598, Apache-2.0):

- crates/dviz-protocol: dviz-core/src/zenoh_protocol.rs (message protocol);
- plugins/dviz/src/rerun_sink.rs: the Rerun logging logic of dviz-shell
  (`log_vis_data_to_rerun`);
- plugins/dviz/src/fake/sim.rs: dviz-rerun-bridge/src/simulation.rs (sensor
  simulator used by the synthetic publisher).

plugins/dviz is distributed under Apache-2.0 for the same reason.
